{"id":73706,"date":"2026-11-10T19:29:09","date_gmt":"2026-11-10T19:29:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73706"},"modified":"2026-11-10T20:35:47","modified_gmt":"2026-11-10T19:35:47","slug":"meia-maratona-de-obidos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-obidos\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, dia <strong>21 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no <strong>Est\u00e1dio Municipal de \u00d3bidos<\/strong> (Bairro dos Arcos, Rua do Gin\u00e1sio), na vila hist\u00f3rica de <strong>\u00d3bidos<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. O secretariado funciona na v\u00e9spera (s\u00e1bado, 20 de fevereiro, das 14:30 \u00e0s 19:00) e na manh\u00e3 da prova (das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:00), antecedendo a partida da Meia Maratona \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> e o arranque da Corrida 10 km e da Caminhada \u00e0s <strong>09:40<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O evento integra tr\u00eas percursos adaptados a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica: a <strong>Meia Maratona de 21,097 km<\/strong> (reservada a maiores de 18 anos, com partida organizada por blocos de ritmo Sub 1h25, Sub 1h40, Sub 1h50 e +1h50 e tempo limite de <strong>3 horas<\/strong>), a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> (aberta a maiores de 16 anos, tempo limite de <strong>2 horas<\/strong>) e a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> de cariz n\u00e3o competitivo (sem idade m\u00ednima, combinando asfalto com tro\u00e7os de terra batida e estrad\u00e3o). Toda a extens\u00e3o do percurso permanece cortada ao tr\u00e2nsito autom\u00f3vel at\u00e9 tr\u00eas horas ap\u00f3s a partida.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong>Ganhar Destak<\/strong> com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de \u00d3bidos<\/strong> e limitada a <strong>1.500 atletas<\/strong>, a competi\u00e7\u00e3o inclui no kit oficial t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (corte masculino\/feminino nas corridas e unissexo na caminhada), dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico descart\u00e1vel, seguro de acidentes pessoais, medalha de finalista e banhos no Est\u00e1dio Municipal de \u00d3bidos. Os participantes dos 21,1 km contam com abastecimentos l\u00edquidos aos 5 km, 10 km, 15 km e meta (com refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido aos 15 km e chegada) e servi\u00e7o opcional de bengaleiro (2,00\u20ac, das 08:30 \u00e0s 13:00), atribuindo-se trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros da Geral M\/F, escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Sub-18 nos 10 km at\u00e9 V60+) e 3 primeiras equipas. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: