trong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 de Fevereiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 10,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 11,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12,00\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13,50\u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos realiza-se no domingo, dia 21 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida e chegada no Est\u00e1dio Municipal de \u00d3bidos (Bairro dos Arcos, Rua do Gin\u00e1sio, 2510-081 \u00d3bidos, distrito de Leiria).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, idades m\u00ednimas e tempos limite de cada dist\u00e2ncia?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Meia Maratona (21,097 km, maiores de 18 anos) parte \u00e0s 09:30 por blocos de ritmo (Sub 1h25, Sub 1h40, Sub 1h50 e +1h50) com limite de 3 horas. A Corrida de 10 km (maiores de 16 anos) e a Caminhada de 8 km (sem idade m\u00ednima, n\u00e3o competitiva) partem ambas \u00e0s 09:40 com tempo limite de 2 horas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o da Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o limitadas a 1.500 atletas e dividem-se em 4 fases at\u00e9 17 de fevereiro de 2027: na 1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 27\/11\/2026) custam 15,00\u20ac (21,1 km), 11,50\u20ac (10 km) e 10,00\u20ac (Caminhada 8 km); na 2\u00aa Fase (28\/11 a 04\/01\/2027) passam a 16,00\u20ac, 12,50\u20ac e 11,00\u20ac; na 3\u00aa Fase (05\/01 a 05\/02\/2027) s\u00e3o 17,50\u20ac, 13,50\u20ac e 12,00\u20ac; e na 4\u00aa Fase (06\/02 a 17\/02\/2027) fixam-se em 20,00\u20ac, 15,00\u20ac e 13,50\u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento do kit?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento individual do kit de atleta decorre no Est\u00e1dio Municipal de \u00d3bidos no s\u00e1bado, dia 20 de fevereiro de 2027, das 14:30 \u00e0s 19:00, e no domingo, dia 21 de fevereiro, das 07:30 \u00e0s 09:00, mediante apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o do comprovativo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsico ou digital.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e que servi\u00e7os de apoio existem no dia da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui t-shirt t\u00e9cnica (masculina\/feminina nas corridas e unissexo na caminhada), dorsal com chip eletr\u00f3nico descart\u00e1vel (corridas), seguro de acidentes pessoais, medalha de finalista para todos e banhos no Est\u00e1dio Municipal de \u00d3bidos. Na Meia Maratona h\u00e1 abastecimentos l\u00edquidos aos 5, 10, 15 km e meta (s\u00f3lidos aos 15 km e meta) e servi\u00e7o opcional de bengaleiro por 2,00\u20ac (08:30\u201313:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e que pr\u00e9mios s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Ganhar Destak com o apoio institucional do Munic\u00edpio de \u00d3bidos. Na Meia Maratona e na Corrida 10 km s\u00e3o entregues trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros classificados da Geral M\/F, aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o et\u00e1rio (Sub-18 nos 10 km at\u00e9 V60+) e \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas (soma dos 3 primeiros independentemente do g\u00e9nero), al\u00e9m de trof\u00e9u para a equipa mais numerosa inscrita.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de \u00d3bidos 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"endDate\": \"